  "selector": "mw-content-text",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\" data-mw-parsoid-version=\"0.24.0.0-alpha15\" data-mw-html-version=\"2.8.0\"><section data-mw-section-id=\"0\" id=\"mwAQ\"><p id=\"mwAg\"><b id=\"mwAw\">Ümmü Hakîm Beyzâ bint Abdülmuttalib</b> (<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arapça\" title=\"Arapça\" id=\"mwBA\">Arapça</a>: أم حكيم البيضاء بنت عبد المطلب), İslam peygamberi <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muhammed\" title=\"Muhammed\" id=\"mwBQ\">Muhammed</a>'in halası ve Halife <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osman\" title=\"Osman\" id=\"mwBg\">Osman</a>'ın anne tarafından büyükannesi.</p>\n\n<p id=\"mwBw\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdülmuttalib_bin_Haşim\" title=\"Abdülmuttalib bin Haşim\" id=\"mwCA\">Abdülmuttalib</a> ve <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fatıma_bint_Amr\" title=\"Fatıma bint Amr\" id=\"mwCQ\">Fatıma bint Amr</a>'ın kızı olarak 546 civarında Mekke'de doğdu.<sup about=\"#mwt6\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Hisham_1-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Hisham\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Hisham-1\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Hisham-1\" id=\"mwCg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwCw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDA\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDQ\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt7\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Saad8_2-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Saad8\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Saad8-2\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Saad8-2\" id=\"mwDg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEA\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEQ\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt1\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEg\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"32\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:32</sup> Ümmü Hakim, Muhammed'in babası <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdullah_bin_Abdülmuttalib\" title=\"Abdullah bin Abdülmuttalib\" id=\"mwEw\">Abdullah</a>'ın ikiz kız kardeşiydi.<sup about=\"#mwt8\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Tabari39_3-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Tabari39\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Tabari39-3\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Tabari39-3\" id=\"mwFA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFg\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFw\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt2\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwGA\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"198\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:198</sup> Ümmü Hakim, Abdülmuttalib'in tek açık tenli kızı olduğu için el-Beyza (\"<i id=\"mwGQ\">beyaz olan</i>\") olarak biliniyordu.<sup about=\"#mwt9\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Tabari39_3-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Tabari39\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Tabari39-3\" id=\"mwGg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwGw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwHA\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwHQ\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt3\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwHg\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"198\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:198</sup> Kureyş kabilesinin Abdüşems boyundan Küreyz bin Rebi'a ile evlendi. Çocukları Amir, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erva_bint_Küreyz\" title=\"Erva bint Küreyz\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwHw\">Erva</a> (gelecekteki Halife Osman'ın annesi), Talha ve Ümmü Talha idi.<sup about=\"#mwt10\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Saad8_2-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Saad8\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Saad8-2\" id=\"mwIA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwIQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwIg\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwIw\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt4\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwJA\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"32\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:32</sup><sup about=\"#mwt11\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Tabari39_3-2\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Tabari39\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Tabari39-3\" id=\"mwJQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwJg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwJw\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwKA\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt5\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwKQ\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"198\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:198</sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwKg\">Ümmü Hakim 610 yılından önce vefat etti.<sup about=\"#mwt13\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Tabari39_3-3\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Tabari39\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Tabari39-3\" id=\"mwKw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwLA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwLQ\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwLg\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt12\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwLw\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"198\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:198</sup></p>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"1\" id=\"mwMA\" aria-labelledby=\"Kaynakça\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Kaynakça\"><span id=\"Kaynak.C3.A7a\" typeof=\"mw:FallbackId\"></span>Kaynakça</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%9Cmm%C3%BC_Hak%C3%AEm_Beyz%C3%A2_bint_Abd%C3%BClmuttalib&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Değiştirilen bölüm: Kaynakça\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>değiştir</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%9Cmm%C3%BC_Hak%C3%AEm_Beyz%C3%A2_bint_Abd%C3%BClmuttalib&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Bölümün kaynak kodunu değiştir: Kaynakça\"><span>kaynağı değiştir</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt14\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwMQ\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Kaynakça\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Kaynakça\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r36973541\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt15\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"templatestyles\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"Kaynakça/styles.css\"}}'>.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-2{column-width:30em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-3{column-width:25em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-